{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对人物动机和心理转折的因果交代不如X充分，尤其是当初为什么离开、为什么又动摇，部分地方压缩得过快；S03、S08的到时感受也稍显密集。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句通过加亮让观众迅速抓住人物每一阶段的核心变化，感受又与音乐进程同步出现，边听边扫更容易建立画面和情绪。它对音乐细节、身体反应和情绪微妙变化的描写也更具体，前后反复出现的亲近、受气、孤单与自我选择形成了清晰的主线。X的优势是叙事解释更完整，人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做交代得更自然，但整体上Y更容易让普通观众在听音乐时获得层次丰富的体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9fc6625f-38d7-4630-8ae5-74f9cb5c9e04", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T212329692053Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.704, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:24:19.424975+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0230bb7f12c775137215ba6e6118735154f66e852d7fd38dec3e643aa6ad9688", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg